OL,3,GNEWSAAdder undergoes surgery for
OL,4,Asuccessful birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA snake in Jersey's zoo had to undergo
OL,7,Fsurgery so its unfertilised eggs could
OL,8,Fbe born.
OL,10,FDurrell Wildlife Conservation Trust
OL,11,Fsaid two adders had given birth -
OL,12,Frather than laying eggs like other
OL,13,Fsnakes - with the assistance of some
OL,14,Fstaff members.
OL,16,FThe trust said it used early
OL,17,Fultrasounds and veterinary care so its
OL,18,Fteams could closely monitor both
OL,19,Fpregnancies. Adders are considered a
OL,20,Fprotected species and a study believes
OL,21,Fthey could disappear from the British
OL,22,Fcountryside by 2032.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
