OL,3,GNEWSAAdder undergoes surgery for
OL,4,Asuccessful birth
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said as one of the pregnancies
OL,7,Fprogressed, the female required surgery
OL,8,Fto "safely remove some unfertilised
OL,9,Feggs, also known as slugs, to protect
OL,10,Fmum and her babies".
